  "releaseHighlights": "- Look Notes is now Look Notes Pro, part of the Dec18 Toolbox membership. A free Lite edition is available too.\n- New Export All Looks: pick a folder and it switches to each look in turn, saves a still of the frame named with the look's label and the date, then puts your original look back.\n- New Build Grid: Export All Looks also saves a Look Grid image with every look side by side, ready to send to a client.\n- New Export Current Look: one click saves the frame as it is right now into your last export folder and shows you the file. Export again after changes and it adds _2, _3 and so on.\n- New Still Format: PNG, JPG or 16 bit TIFF. The Look Grid isn't available with JPG.\n- The Get the Whole Toolbox button is gone from Pro.\n- Saved projects keep their looks, notes and settings.",
