      "releaseHighlights": "- New Reframe checkbox: Bottom Strip or Side Panel. The picture shrinks to fit and the notes get their own panel instead of sitting on the image, with Panel Size, Background and Background Brightness controls.\n- New Palette: 3 to 12 colour swatches pulled from the image, shown in the reframe panel. Sort by hue, dominance or brightness, and skip near blacks, near whites and greys.\n- Node toggling now works on Windows too (needs Python 3 from python.org), and it is always on, so the Toggle Look Nodes switch is gone.\n- New Get the Whole Toolbox button opens the Dec18 Studios tools page.\n- EB Garamond is now bundled, so Garamond mode works everywhere even without a system Garamond.\n- Saved projects keep their looks, notes and settings.",
